[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=19 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="两份一致的端口，能不能先接小电源？只试这边，或许就能知道另一边的编号。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森没有马上反驳。她把测试线放到你面前，让你指出从哪里开始，哪个部件保证电流不会沿着旧回路走进那块未确认的板。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我不知道。图上这段看着已经分开，可我没看过里面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="那我们现在缺的是实际隔离，不是再挑一个听起来更小的电源。你可以提出试，我也得有办法在它不按图走的时候停。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你盯着端口看了一会儿，发现自己刚才把“我只想试一小段”误当成了“只会影响一小段”。动机再谨慎，也不会替铜线改变通路。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那先别接。我是不是又把想知道的事放得太前面？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="有一点。也不算犯错，我们还没接。你问出来，我说不够条件，到这里本来就可以换方案，不用先给自己判一次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我以前试过一只很小的灯，结果整间屋都黑了。说这个不是给你壮胆，是告诉你拉姆森当时也这样瞪我。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="因为你黑灯以后还问能不能换个更亮的灯泡。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿把脸埋进袖口，笑得不太好意思。你跟着笑了一下，刚才那种必须立刻证明自己没想错的紧绷，终于慢慢松下来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那要满足什么条件，才值得试？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="完整隔离、限流、独立切断，再找一个懂板的人在旁边。今天缺最后两项，不是永远不试。把要准备什么写上，下回来才不是重新吵一遍。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们把尚缺条件列在索引里，给维修班留能用的步骤，把有疑点的控制板单独封存。帕金斯没有把你最初的提议从记录里删掉，旁边写明未执行及原因。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="留着这句，会不会有人觉得我差点害人？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="他也会看见有人问、有人指出风险、命令在执行前改了。我们如果只留最后那句完美答案，下一个人碰到相同想法，就不知道从哪里停。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把笔放下，向拉姆森道谢。她说先把工具盒盖好，德雷顿那杯水离得太近。你们一人挪了一样东西，终于把桌面收整齐，能去处理真正需要现在动手的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

